   "record": "9149bd69772ba18500e92edeeb9720688fff2d6744192cd8e374712b7479184d",
   "status": "DISAGREE",
   "ruling": "Ruling: model error; the candidate reads f1040.line3a whatever box 1a is above zero, so it needs that answer where the source does not: i1040gi p. 25, Line 3a, \"Qualified dividends are also included in the ordinary dividend total required to be shown on line 3b\": with box 1a (line 3b) zero, line 3a is zero. The project reads the gate line f1040.line3a_if_ordinary, which takes f1040.line3a when box 1a is above zero holds and zero otherwise; the interview asks f1040.line3a only then (gated_by f1040.line3a_if_ordinary), so on every return the interview can produce with the condition true the two sides agree. Ruled by reading: the scoped reply names interfaces the candidate bank does not resolve, as in the earlier line-scoped passes of this lane.",
   "subject_key": "1a744c493bef4e3db86f5a2bac1586080a983f545e249a2bdd38e4ff48fc68ff"
  },
  {
   "key": "3",
   "record": "9149bd69772ba18500e92edeeb9720688fff2d6744192cd8e374712b7479184d",
   "status": "DISAGREE",
   "ruling": "Ruling: equivalent representation; project retained. The No branch reads “Enter the amount from Form 1040 or 1040-SR, line 7a” (i1040gi p. 38). When Schedule D is not required, line 7a carries the total capital gain distributions from Form 1099-DIV box 2a (i1040gi p. 33, line 7a, Exception 1), the value the project references directly through its gate line sd.distributions_if_dividends (box 2a when dividends or distributions were received, zero otherwise); the candidate references line 7a literally, as in the earlier ruling of this line.",
   "subject_key": "6514f5e5258e0c6861fdb3aee42c3591371a7356fe93b9c9878f2c996745924a"
  },
  {
